"Da li bi se aplikacija trebala zatvoriti kada korisnik pritisne X dugme."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (startMinimized), group (General)
#: misc/kftpgrabber.kcfg:75
#, kde-format
msgid "Should the application be started minimized."
msgstr "Da li bi se aplikacija trebala pokrenuti minimizirana."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (showSplash), group (General)
#: misc/kftpgrabber.kcfg:80
#, kde-format
msgid "Should the splash screen be displayed when starting the application."
