"Da li bi pozdravni zaslon trebao biti prikazan kada se pokreće aplikacija."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (showSystrayIcon), group (General)
#: misc/kftpgrabber.kcfg:85
#, kde-format
msgid "Should the systray icon be displayed."
msgstr "Da li bi ikona u donjem uglu  sistema trebala biti prikazana?"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (showWalletSites), group (General)
#: misc/kftpgrabber.kcfg:90
#, kde-format
msgid "Should the sites from KWallet be shown among the bookmarks."
msgstr "Da li bi se stranice sa KWallet-a trebale prikazati među oznakama."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (confirmDisconnects), group (General)
#: misc/kftpgrabber.kcfg:95
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Should a \"confirm disconnect\" dialog be displayed each time a disconnect "
"is requested."
msgstr ""
"Da li bi se \"potvrdi isključenje\" dijalog trebao prikazati svaki put kada "
"se traži isključenje."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (defEncoding), group (General)
#: misc/kftpgrabber.kcfg:100
#, kde-format
msgid "The default site encoding."
msgstr "Kodiranje zadane stranice."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (recentSites), group (General)
#: misc/kftpgrabber.kcfg:104
#, kde-format
msgid "Recent sites accessed via quick connect."
msgstr "Nedavnim stranicama pristupljeno putem brzog povezivanja."

